<title>USA: Vesta Fire Insurance to open branch in Denmark.</title>
<headline>Vesta Fire Insurance to open branch in Denmark.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vesta Fire Insurance Corp said on Thursday it was going to open a branch in Copenhagen, Denmark on September 1 for European reinsurance operations.</p>
<p>Vesta Insurance Group Inc, headquartered in Birmingham, Alabama, is a holding company for a group of property and casualty insurance companies which offer insurance and reinsurance products.</p>
<p>Vesta Fire Insurance Corp is the lead insurance company in the Vesta organization with over $330 million in statutory surplus.</p>
